  "notes": "Fleet fighter carrier. Two squadrons of twelve Wasp heavy fighters, each in its own full hangar so it can be rearmed and repaired between sorties, and a ship's boat for liaison and rescue. Jump-3 lets it keep pace with a cruiser squadron; thrust 2 means it should never be where the fighting is. Point defence and a light turret battery are for whatever gets past the fighters."
